# The Social Engineering window (see socialwin.c) and the limit of one bar of the energy allocation (10 tenths). From economy 50%, psych
# 0% and labs 50%, nine clicks on the + of psych take it to 90% (labs first, then economy, give it up: the first five from labs); the
# - of economy then takes economy's last tenth, which the next bar round (psych) takes up to its limit, 100%; the allocation then
# is economy 0%, psych 100% and labs 0%, and the + of psych can take no more: a click on it leaves the bars as they are. A - on labs, at
# none already, gives nothing and takes from the next (economy) that has none: nothing changes.
# The bars' buttons are at y 719: economy - 24 and + 244, psych - 271 and + 496, labs - 522 and + 748.
# Leave time after each step; the snaps take 2 s each.
25 load
42 state ifc 0x8a6c9c 8
42 state work 0x8a6f64 0x74
42 state alloc 0x8a8e94 0x3c
42 state rects 0x8c5240 0x320
42 state energy_a 0x749ae4 4
42 state energy_b 0x749c0c 4
44 click 362 734
50 open social_open
56 click 475 736
60 snap open
62 click 496 719
63 click 496 719
